      "receiptSource": "Original Receipt in \u003Ca href=\u0022references.html#francatelli-1852\u0022\u003E\u003Cb\u003EFrancatelli 1852\u003C/b\u003E\u003C/a\u003E;",
      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003ENo. 165. Egg-hot.\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\nPut a pint of beer on the fire to warm, break an egg into a jug, add a table-spoonful of sugar and some grated nutmeg or ginger; beat all together with a fork for three minutes; then add a drop of the beer, stir well together, and pour the remainder of the hot beer to this, and continue pouring the egg-hot out of the warming-pot into the jug for two minutes, when it will be well mixed and ready to drink.\u003Cbr\u003E"
    }
